[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13148.429, "timestamp": "03:39:08", "text": "但最终我想要的也只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13151.55, "timestamp": "03:39:11", "text": "让我的家人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13153.79, "timestamp": "03:39:13", "text": "知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13156.269, "timestamp": "03:39:16", "text": "我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13160.429, "timestamp": "03:39:20", "text": "在这里，我们也经常一起出去玩。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13165.309, "timestamp": "03:39:25", "text": "我们齐心协力，竭尽全力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13166.99, "timestamp": "03:39:26", "text": "家庭。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13177.469, "timestamp": "03:39:37", "text": "嗨，喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13180.19, "timestamp": "03:39:40", "text": "那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13183.79, "timestamp": "03:39:43", "text": "还。等等，你的发音是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13187.35, "timestamp": "03:39:47", "text": "姓名？我想念出你的名字"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13193.87, "timestamp": "03:39:53", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13199.309, "timestamp": "03:39:59", "text": "嗯？"}]